{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Brings.brings_is_qou","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Brings.brings_is_qou","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.brings_is_qou","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.brings_is_qou","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/brings_is_qou.lean#L35-L63","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript).\n\nBring's surface $\\Sigma_4$ ([Bring's surface](#def\\:brings-surface))\ngives rise to a quantum observable universe over $R$ (with\n$30 \\in R^{\\times}$).  The five sub-claims:\n\n(i) Quantum universe — the realisation is $\\mathbf{C} = \\mathrm{Rep}(\\mathrm{SU}_q(2))$,\n    i.e. quantum-group arity $2$;\n(ii) Observability — $\\dim \\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathbf 1, \\mathrm{Ad}\\,A) = 0$\n    (quantum Schur lemma);\n(iii) Yekutieli lifting — perpetual obstruction $\\forall n,\\ \\kappa_n \\ne 0$\n    (the lone open categorical input, carried by `[BringsObstruction]`);\n(iv) Euler characteristic — $g = 4$ and $\\chi(A) = 2 - 2g = -6$\n    (**derived** arithmetic);\n(v) Geometric descent (Riemann–Hurwitz) — $6$ branch points, total\n    ramification $14$.\n\nOnly sub-claim (iii) is assumed; (i), (ii), (iv), (v) are discharged by\n`norm_num` / `rfl`.  In particular `χ(A) = -6` is *derived* from\n`χ(A) = 2 - 2·4`, not asserted independently. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:brings-is-qou","label":"prop:brings-is-qou","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/brings-is-qou.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction.kappa_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction.kappa_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/brings_is_qou.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Perpetual obstruction: every obstruction class is non-zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction.kappa","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction.kappa","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/brings_is_qou.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Obstruction classes `κ_n` indexed by jet level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction.mk","kind":"ctor","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/brings_is_qou.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Brings.BringsObstruction","kind":"class","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Brings/brings_is_qou.lean#L24-L33","doc":"The one genuinely-open categorical input for `brings_is_qou`: the\nYekutieli **perpetual obstruction** — every jet-level obstruction\nclass `κ_n` is non-zero, so no finite-order lift exists.  A\ncategorical proof is open (the §3b conjectural hypothesis); the\nnumerical/arithmetic sub-claims below are *derived*. ","signatureChunk":0}]}